  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph1": "AWA Together epesi yo nzela ya kotala bobele makambo oyo molongani na yo aponi kotikela yo.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph2": "Na ndakisa, okoki komona mwa makambo oyo etali sanza na ye, eleko na ye ya komona sanza, to ntango azali na bana mingi.",
