  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingDescription": "Osengeli kosala nini soki makambo ezali komonana te, lokola ete boyokani na yo ebebi, to ozali na likambo mosusu.",
  "awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph1": "Soki makambo mosusu ezali komonana te, banda na kotala soki Internet na yo ezali kosala malamu.",
